<title>JAPAN: Toyota plans to pay 96/97 dividend of 22 yen.</title>
<headline>Toyota plans to pay 96/97 dividend of 22 yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp said on Thursday it planned to pay an annual dividend of 22 yen for the year to March 31, 1997, up from 19 yen a year earlier.  </p>
<p>The plan will have to be approved at Toyota's annual shareholders' meeting scheduled to be held at the end of June, Toyota said in a statement.</p>
